# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit .env.
#
# @rack-rate/data-cli loads this file from the repository root on every
# invocation, whatever the working directory. A variable that is already set in
# the environment always wins over the value in this file.

# Artificial Analysis API key — https://artificialanalysis.ai/data-api
# Needed only to run `bun run fetch:artificial-analysis`. Both this key and
# AA_PUBLISH=1 are required: the fetcher's gate is conjunctive
# (packages/data-cli/src/commands/fetch-artificial-analysis.ts), so a key alone
# never fetches, publishes or writes an AA value. CAVEATS.md §1 records the
# owner's unresolved licensing position.
# AA_API_KEY=

# Enables Artificial Analysis publication. Only the exact value `1` turns it on;
# unset, empty, `0` or anything else keeps AA off. Committed AA rows while
# AA_PUBLISH is not `1` fail `bun run validate`.
# AA_PUBLISH=

# Optional path to the `harbor` executable, used only by the Terminal-Bench
# fetcher's fallback after the flight-data path fails. When unset or empty, PATH
# is searched for `harbor`.
# HARBOR_BIN=

# Not read by this repository: HARBOR_API_KEY authenticates the `harbor` CLI
# itself (`harbor auth login`, or an `sk-harbor-…` key) for Hub operations that
# need a login. The public leaderboard read used here needs no key.
